.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH label 1  "label " 
.SH NAME
label \- Work with repository labels
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlabel\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Work with repository labels
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
label\-list(1)
List labels
.TP
label\-create(1)
Create a label
.TP
label\-edit(1)
Edit a label identified by its current name
.TP
label\-delete(1)
Delete a label (asks for confirmation unless \-\-yes)
.TP
label\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
